+            bid_included:
+              description: |
+                From Gloas onwards, the node has received a block (from P2P or API) containing an external Builder's bid that is successfully imported on the fork-choice `on_block` handler.
+                This includes valid imported blocks that do not become the head. The event does not wait for an execution payload envelope to be received.
+                No event is emitted for pre-Gloas blocks or self-built blocks whose bid has `builder_index` equal to `BUILDER_INDEX_SELF_BUILD`.
+
+                All four fields are required. `slot` is the imported beacon block's slot and `block_root` is its beacon block root.
+                `block_hash` and `builder_index` contain `signed_execution_payload_bid.message.block_hash` and
+                `signed_execution_payload_bid.message.builder_index` from that block.
+                `slot` and `builder_index` are quoted decimal uint64 values. `block_root` and `block_hash` are `0x`-prefixed 32-byte values.
+                The event contains no `execution_optimistic`, `bid_root`, or complete signed bid. The existing `block` event is unchanged.
+              value: |
+                event: bid_included
+                data: {"slot":"10", "block_root":"0x9a2fefd2fdb57f74993c7780ea5b9030d2897b615b89f808011ca5aebed54eaf", "block_hash":"0x76262e91970d375a19bfe8a867288d7b9cde43c8635f598d93d39d041706fc76", "builder_index":"42"}
             block_gossip:
               description: The node has received a block (from P2P or API) that passes validation rules of the `beacon_block` topic
